    "landing_kit_contents_tVeeY9": {
      "type": "landing-kit-contents",
      "blocks": {
        "item_tYNHKC": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/800px_BEST_DAD_BOOK-7.jpg",
            "label": "The playbook\nwith 28 missions",
            "text": "<p>We don’t promise perfect fatherhood, just 28 chances for <strong>Dad to show up, pull something off and really be there.</strong> The kid gets a dad. The phone gets a break. It doesn’t have to be perfect. It just has to happen.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_jBh7iV": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/I_AM_BEST_Sticker.jpg",
            "label": "28 gold-foil\ntrophy stickers",
            "text": "<p><strong>One shiny trophy for every completed mission.</strong> Dad and kid stick it on the poster together and celebrate a successful adventure. Dads need a medal now and then too.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_7U48yT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Best_Dad_Poster-with-dad-1.jpg",
            "label": "The Dad Achievement\nPoster",
            "text": "<p>The poster isn’t just a place for stickers. Hanging on the wall next to your kid’s bed, it becomes a map of your adventures together. <strong>Every sticker reminds your kid that Dad was there</strong>, <strong>that you did something together</strong> and that the next mission is waiting.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_JrdXEh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Bestdad_Bundle_05.jpg",
            "label": "A letter from Santa\nin an envelope from\nthe North Pole",
            "text": "<p>In his letter, Santa encourages your kid to <strong>pass on the toys they no longer play with</strong>. If they won’t listen to Dad, maybe they’ll listen to Santa. Personally.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
