      "settings": {
        "heading": "There’s a mission for every dad.",
        "band_text": "For brand-new dads, veteran dads, stepdads, adoptive dads and weekend dads.",
        "body": "<p>Let’s be honest: Dad doesn’t need to have it all figured out. He doesn’t need to invent jokes or entertain a crowd. It’s enough that he joins the game.</p><p>He can start with a bedtime story or a paper boat. He should pick a mission he and his kid both enjoy. No need to show off for the whole neighborhood.</p>",
        "text_align": "center",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "note": "",
